5:  [H-S01,H-S05]               * Sales
6:  ^5A + 4A                    *     =
7:  H-M01                       * Miscellaneous Income
8:  N-P01                       * Proceeds of Disposed Assets
9:  ^8A + 7A                    * OTHER INCOME
10: ^9A + 6A                    * GROSS PROFIT
11:   =                         * Dummy
